{"4074890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sibling Steelers ~Forge & Family~", "steam_appid": 4074890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Pixel Art RPG◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RPG created with RPG Maker MZ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆How to Play◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Earn money to make your sister's dream come true</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Defeat monsters and collect materials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Craft weapons using the materials you gather</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Sell your crafted weapons for profit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Time passes as you defeat monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Can you beat the game before ten days run out...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Story◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a small village lives a young blacksmith by the name of Alyssa, whose dream is to open her own a smithy in the royal capital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Alyssa's little brother, spares no effort in helping her achieve this goal. But in order for them to realize this dream together—they need money first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Alyssa's brother, exploring dungeons, collecting materials, and completing various events for the sake of your sister's dream...</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Pixel Art RPG◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RPG created with RPG Maker MZ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆How to Play◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Earn money to make your sister's dream come true</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Defeat monsters and collect materials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Craft weapons using the materials you gather</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Sell your crafted weapons for profit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Time passes as you defeat monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Can you beat the game before ten days run out...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Story◆</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a small village lives a young blacksmith by the name of Alyssa, whose dream is to open her own a smithy in the royal capital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Alyssa's little brother, spares no effort in helping her achieve this goal. But in order for them to realize this dream together—they need money first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Alyssa's brother, exploring dungeons, collecting materials, and completing various events for the sake of your sister's dream...</p>", "short_description": "This game is created with RPG Maker MZ. Play as Alyssa's brother, slaying monsters, collecting materials in dungeons, and completing various events for the sake of your sister's dream...", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074890/3b33efd92abd8fe83e31aafae1d38ccdd94e028e/header.jpg?t=1782996752", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074890/9d8f2134d1ff729c2d3fd7baec4452773aefaf32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782996752", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074890/9d8f2134d1ff729c2d3fd7baec4452773aefaf32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782996752", "website": "https://shiravune.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4340 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Compatible OpenGL / VRAM 1GB or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1280x768 or better Display</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> W